---
Import a game's settings

Usage: easyplay import [OPTIONS] --exe <FILE> <FILE>

Arguments:
  <FILE>  The exported settings file

Options:
      --exe <FILE>  The program the settings apply to
  -v, --verbose...  Increase log verbosity (-v debug, -vv trace)
  -h, --help        Print help
